    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_vegetable_oils; processing_state=refined_extract; wd_term=seed oil; wd_relation=skos:broadMatch): 'Oil, Seed' (Annual Statement 1896, in tons, flagged 'New Commodity') is seed oil, the inverted customs form of htc:0790 'Seed Oil'; it had been anchored to 'oil seed' (the seeds). Layer-1 observations: 10 rows, 1896–1896. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×10. Units: Tons ×10. Top routes: Denmark → United Kingdom ×1; France → United Kingdom ×1; Holland → United Kingdom ×1; World → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
